(7209138, 1110924, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition. Great use of the wide angle to capture a really interesting foreground, with leading, current-pulling lines, no less. Great contrast and dark elements on the bottom right and top left also enhance the framing. Shimmery silver water. And the flow of the clouds match that of the water in the foreground. Great stuff.</td>', 'Fantastic composition. Great use of the wide angle to capture a really interesting foreground, with leading, current-pulling lines, no less. Great contrast and dark elements on the bottom right and top left also enhance the framing. Shimmery silver water. And the flow of the clouds match that of the water in the foreground. Great stuff.', '2014-04-28 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
