(7209196, 1111029, 63218, '<td valign="top">I had the most fun, looking at this. At first I saw only one eye. I was thinking Nice shot, too bad there is only one eye, when the rest of the face came into focus in my mind. I was transfixed by the gaze of those 2 unflinching eyes. Awesome!</td>', 'I had the most fun, looking at this. At first I saw only one eye. I was thinking Nice shot, too bad there is only one eye, when the rest of the face came into focus in my mind. I was transfixed by the gaze of those 2 unflinching eyes. Awesome!', '2014-04-28 01:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
