(7209606, 1111005, 60173, '<td valign="top">My husband was listening to "Slow Ride" by Foghat as I came across this image. It cracked me up, because I can just imagine the strut this bold little rooster must have as he patrols his domain.</td>', 'My husband was listening to "Slow Ride" by Foghat as I came across this image. It cracked me up, because I can just imagine the strut this bold little rooster must have as he patrols his domain.', '2014-04-28 21:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
