(7209609, 1110547, 60173, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this one is going to get overlooked, but I must say, I really like it. It''s not a showy DPC type entry, but it''s definitely solid, and in the right application would be seen in all its glory. The angle choice is unexpected and interesting. It makes me want to know more. Nice job.</td>', 'I have a feeling this one is going to get overlooked, but I must say, I really like it. It''s not a showy DPC type entry, but it''s definitely solid, and in the right application would be seen in all its glory. The angle choice is unexpected and interesting. It makes me want to know more. Nice job.', '2014-04-28 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209610, 1110110, 167257, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2014-04-28 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7209611, 1111012, 60173, '<td valign="top">This plays tricks with my eyes a little. I know this is simply drawn in the sand with a finger or stick or something, but for some reason my eyes want to see it as an aerial photo of a whole beach with some sort of track carved into it. Maybe it''s the lighting? Pretty cool.</td>', 'This plays tricks with my eyes a little. I know this is simply drawn in the sand with a finger or stick or something, but for some reason my eyes want to see it as an aerial photo of a whole beach with some sort of track carved into it. Maybe it''s the lighting? Pretty cool.', '2014-04-28 21:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
