(7211356, 1110992, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love this image of masses of light and dark wherein the water and shadows attain parity and there''s an undercurrent of intimate drama.  The light masses are more finely broken up into individual rocks and vegetation. The dark masses have some sparkle and translucence.  The young woman is wonderfully posed, seemingly held down by shadow. My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this image of masses of light and dark wherein the water and shadows attain parity and there''s an undercurrent of intimate drama.  The light masses are more finely broken up into individual rocks and vegetation. The dark masses have some sparkle and translucence.  The young woman is wonderfully posed, seemingly held down by shadow. My favorite in the challenge.', '2014-05-02 16:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211361, 1110814, 173844, '<td valign="top">Straightforward and romantic, lovingly composed and dreamy.  Great use of grain.  Beautifully complimented and complicated by the tubing and reflected image on the left.  The tones are wonderfully graduated.  Fine stuff.</td>', 'Straightforward and romantic, lovingly composed and dreamy.  Great use of grain.  Beautifully complimented and complicated by the tubing and reflected image on the left.  The tones are wonderfully graduated.  Fine stuff.', '2014-05-02 16:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211365, 1110546, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific artistic image.  Very serene.  Nicely truncated (no pun intended) reflections.  Appealingly dappled with underwater rocks.  Handsome result.</td>', 'Terrific artistic image.  Very serene.  Nicely truncated (no pun intended) reflections.  Appealingly dappled with underwater rocks.  Handsome result.', '2014-05-02 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
