(7212327, 1110778, 147314, '<td valign="top">There''s something wrong with the post-processing IMO: huge fringes/halos around the fence wires and the concrete post as well above the trees in the background and also the processing of the sky looks a bit odd.</td>', 'There''s something wrong with the post-processing IMO: huge fringes/halos around the fence wires and the concrete post as well above the trees in the background and also the processing of the sky looks a bit odd.', '2014-05-04 19:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
