(7212490, 1110455, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely child caught in an appealing moment of distraction.  There is some dissonance, for me, between the sharply observed face and the blur of the rest of the body. Maybe I just don''t understand the lens or depth of focus.  In any case, it''s a fine portrait.</td>', 'Lovely child caught in an appealing moment of distraction.  There is some dissonance, for me, between the sharply observed face and the blur of the rest of the body. Maybe I just don''t understand the lens or depth of focus.  In any case, it''s a fine portrait.', '2014-05-04 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212495, 1110886, 173844, '<td valign="top">A transitory moment lovingly and humbly presented.  With the gum above the glimmer one might even see a ghost or an angel.  Hyper-realism becomes abstract here in bold composition and line.</td>', 'A transitory moment lovingly and humbly presented.  With the gum above the glimmer one might even see a ghost or an angel.  Hyper-realism becomes abstract here in bold composition and line.', '2014-05-04 23:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
