(7212894, 1110957, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''ve used the <a href="//www.topazlabs.com/333.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Topaz Labs</a> <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Van_dyke_brown" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Van Dyke Brown</a> treatment and got the same response in a juried Photo Club evening. They all hated it. Suffices to say that 4/5 Judges and ALL the participants had never heard of it and all but 1 got into photography in the Digital era..<br/>In the age of the knowledge and information super highways they are pretty stupid. Needless to say I am no longer a member.</td>', 'I''ve used the Topaz Labs Van Dyke Brown treatment and got the same response in a juried Photo Club evening. They all hated it. Suffices to say that 4/5 Judges and ALL the participants had never heard of it and all but 1 got into photography in the Digital era..In the age of the knowledge and information super highways they are pretty stupid. Needless to say I am no longer a member.', '2014-05-05 14:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
